From: Oleksii Kulinich <entaytion@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 18:03:38 +0300
Subject: Fall back to the archived copy when a preserved message's cache is gone

SavedMessagesHelper already copies a deleted-but-preserved message's media to
Downloads/entinyGram/media on deletion, but nothing ever read that copy back:
the chat bubble kept resolving its file the normal way, through the stock
cache. Once that cache entry got evicted (autoclean, or the user clearing
cache by hand) the still-visible bubble had no way to show its voice/image
again, even though the archived copy was sitting there untouched the whole
time - reported by a user as "sometimes the media survives, sometimes it
doesn't" and "after I clear cache, saved voice/images stop showing".

- FileLoader.getPathToMessage now checks SavedMessagesHelper.getArchivedMediaPath
  as a last resort, after the existing self-destruct-media fallback chain, for
  both TL_messageMediaDocument (voice notes, files) and TL_messageMediaPhoto
- SavedMessagesHelper keeps a synchronous in-memory index (account -> dialogId
  -> msgId -> path) alongside the existing deleted-message caches, populated on
  both the initial per-account DB load and on every new deletion, so the
  file-loading path never touches SQLite directly
- InuDatabaseHelper.forEachDeletedMessageMedia streams the media_path column
  for that initial load

Only affects messages already tracked as deleted+preserved; every other
media load is unaffected past one cheap in-memory lookup.
---
 .../src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/FileLoader.java  | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/FileLoader.java b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/FileLoader.java
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/FileLoader.java
+++ b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/FileLoader.java
@@ -1300,6 +1300,10 @@ public class FileLoader extends BaseController {
                     File encCacheRes = new File(cacheRes.getPath() + ".enc");
                     if (encCacheRes.exists()) return encCacheRes;
                 }
+                if (!res.exists()) {
+                    File archivedRes = desu.inugram.helpers.chat.SavedMessagesHelper.getArchivedMediaPath(currentAccount, MessageObject.getDialogId(message), message.id);
+                    if (archivedRes != null) return archivedRes;
+                }
                 return res;
             } else if (MessageObject.getMedia(message) instanceof TLRPC.TL_messageMediaPhoto) {
                 ArrayList<TLRPC.PhotoSize> sizes = MessageObject.getMedia(message).photo.sizes;
@@ -1316,6 +1320,10 @@ public class FileLoader extends BaseController {
                             File encCacheRes = new File(cacheRes.getPath() + ".enc");
                             if (encCacheRes.exists()) return encCacheRes;
                         }
+                        if (!res.exists()) {
+                            File archivedRes = desu.inugram.helpers.chat.SavedMessagesHelper.getArchivedMediaPath(currentAccount, MessageObject.getDialogId(message), message.id);
+                            if (archivedRes != null) return archivedRes;
+                        }
                         return res;
                     }
                 }
